@meta
id: 13-20
title: Drill — land on the value
chapter: 13
type: drill
skills: regex-zs-ze, regex-verymagic
par: 35
minutes: 5
reps: 8
vscode: find the 5xx line, then click on the word at the far end of it
open: errors.json

@brief
Eight times: one error in this registry has a `5xx` status code and
`sentry` set to `false`. Server errors go to Sentry. Set that one to
`true`.

The status code is what identifies the line. The flag is at the other
end of the line, and that is where the cursor needs to arrive.

@keys
| `\zs` | context before, match after |
| `.*` | the gap between them |
| `cw` | change the word under the cursor |

@hints
Put the code and the gap before `\zs`, and `false` after it.
--
`/\v5\d\d.*\zsfalse` `Enter`, then `cwtrue` and `Esc`.

@solution
/\v5\d\d.*\zsfalse<Enter>  cwtrue<Esc>  :wq<Enter>

Thirty keystrokes, and no travel along the line.

The pattern says: three digits starting with a five, then anything,
then `false` — and start the match at `false`. Everything before the
`\zs` is a condition on the line; the cursor never visits it.

By rep eight, putting the context first and `\zs` before the target
should feel like the natural order to write a pattern in: *where*,
then *what*.

@start errors.json
{
  "ORDER_NOT_FOUND": { "statusCode": 404, "sentry": false },
  "ORDER_ALREADY_SHIPPED": { "statusCode": 409, "sentry": false },
  "ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE": { "statusCode": 409, "sentry": false },
  "CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND": { "statusCode": 404, "sentry": false },
  "REFUND_EXCEEDS_TOTAL": { "statusCode": 422, "sentry": false },
  "REFUND_DECLINED": { "statusCode": 402, "sentry": false },
  "PAYMENT_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT": { "statusCode": 504, "sentry": true },
  "PAYOUT_EXPORT_FAILED": { "statusCode": 502, "sentry": false },
  "WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_MISMATCH": { "statusCode": 401, "sentry": false },
  "LEDGER_UNAVAILABLE": { "statusCode": 503, "sentry": true }
}

@expected errors.json
{
  "ORDER_NOT_FOUND": { "statusCode": 404, "sentry": false },
  "ORDER_ALREADY_SHIPPED": { "statusCode": 409, "sentry": false },
  "ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE": { "statusCode": 409, "sentry": false },
  "CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND": { "statusCode": 404, "sentry": false },
  "REFUND_EXCEEDS_TOTAL": { "statusCode": 422, "sentry": false },
  "REFUND_DECLINED": { "statusCode": 402, "sentry": false },
  "PAYMENT_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT": { "statusCode": 504, "sentry": true },
  "PAYOUT_EXPORT_FAILED": { "statusCode": 502, "sentry": true },
  "WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_MISMATCH": { "statusCode": 401, "sentry": false },
  "LEDGER_UNAVAILABLE": { "statusCode": 503, "sentry": true }
}
